'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Building an immutable replacement
participant RecipeChanges as Changes
participant "original: Recipe" as Original
participant "edited: Recipe" as Edited
Changes -> Changes : applyTo(original)
Changes -> Original : read omitted fields through getters
Original --> Changes : original values
note over Changes, Original
 Supplied fields replace original values.
 Omitted fields keep original values.
end note
create Edited
Changes -> Edited : new Recipe(merged fields)
note over Changes, Edited
 Constructor validates the complete recipe.
 Original recipe is unchanged.
end note

@enduml
'@@author
